+        // hanbang (10/9): while L2 is held in a one-screen layout (top only / bottom only), the other screen slides up from the bottom
+        // as a translucent pop-up (75% size, rounded corners), like the Android 'pop-up screen' builds. In 'top only' the touch cursor
